-- `quote_ident` over every keyword 18.6 has (`pg_get_keywords()`, all four categories):
-- an unreserved one comes back bare and every other one quoted, by 18.6's own keyword
-- table — where pglet's lexer would quote some unreserved words (`action`) that 18.6 leaves
-- bare. The list is 18.6's, read off the oracle; a keyword a later major adds is not here.
-- Ordered by position rather than by the word, so the two engines' collations cannot move
-- a row.
-- @test
